# Harried Dronesmith: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with
# flying. It gains haste until end of turn. Sacrifice it at the beginning of your next end step." Turn 1 Bot1 casts it off a
# Mountain and a Black Lotus; at the beginning of combat the trigger makes one Thopter, which has haste, so it attacks at
# once (Bot2 20 -> 19), is still there in the second main phase (so it is not sacrificed at the combat's end), and is gone
# at the end step (CR 603.7c).

